POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/calls
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "peer_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "kind": "audio"
}

### 18. Список звонков
### GET /api/v1/calls
### 200 OK
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/calls?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

